-- title:
--   Serre–Tate lifting: formal group lifts come from Weierstrass lifts
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $q \neq 2$ and let $k$ be a field of characteristic $q$. Let $E_0$ be an elliptic Weierstrass curve over $k$ whose formal group satisfies `IsDrinfeldBasisAdic ⊥ q 0 0`, that is: taking the ideal of $k$ to be $\bot$, the series `nthSeries q` of $E_0$.`formalGroup` is a unit power series times `drinfeldDivisor q 0 0`. Let $W_0$ be a complete discrete valuation domain, adically complete for its maximal ideal, with maximal ideal generated by $q$, together with a surjective ring map $\mathrm{res}_0 : W_0 \to k$ whose kernel is that maximal ideal. Let $T$ be an Artinian local $W_0$-algebra with a surjective ring map $\mathrm{res}_T : T \to k$ whose kernel is the maximal ideal of $T$ and which is compatible with $\mathrm{res}_0$ along $W_0 \to T$. Let $G$ be a commutative formal group over $T$ with $G$.`IsBaseChange`, i.e. the two-variable power series of $E_0$.`formalGroup` is the image of that of $G$ under $\mathrm{res}_T$. Then there are a Weierstrass curve $E$ over $T$ with $E$.`map` $\mathrm{res}_T = E_0$, a formal group $G'$ over $T$ whose underlying series is $E$.`formalGroupLawFixed`, and a `LawIso` $\psi$ from $G'$ to $G$ (a power series with vanishing constant term, unit linear coefficient, intertwining the two laws) whose coefficients satisfy $\mathrm{res}_T(\mathrm{coeff}_n \psi) = \delta_{n,1}$.
--
--   This is the existence half of Serre–Tate theory in Weierstrass form: over an Artinian local base with supersingular (Drinfeld-basis) reduction, every commutative formal-group deformation of the formal group of $E_0$ is realised, up to a star-isomorphism reducing to the identity, by the formal group law of a Weierstrass lift of $E_0$. It is used in the construction of level structures on the relevant deformation data, being cited by [`ModularCurve.LevelModuliPackageAbs.exists_raw_lawIso_appAdic_eq_of_isDrinfeldBasisAdic_gamma0Pow`](thm.html#ModularCurve.LevelModuliPackageAbs.exists_raw_lawIso_appAdic_eq_of_isDrinfeldBasisAdic_gamma0Pow).
